Compile or call model profiles from canonical state.

Usage:
  strap llm compile [--model current] [--tools all]
  strap llm call [--model current] [--tools all]
  strap llm complete [--model current] [--tools all]

Usage:
  strap llm compile --provider config/strap/providers/openai.json
  strap llm complete --provider config/strap/providers/chatgpt.json
